INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com
2. Create new project "PDFSecureDrive"
3. APIs & Services → Enable "Google Drive API"
4. APIs & Services → Credentials → Create → OAuth 2.0 Client ID → Android
5. Package name: com.pdfsecuredrive.app
6. SHA-1 fingerprint (get via):
   keytool -list -v -keystore ~/.android/debug.keystore -alias androiddebugkey -storepass android -keypass android
7. Download the real google-services.json and rename it (remove .TEMPLATE)
